# ── MARK LVI — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
config/api_keys.json
.keys
.keys/
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json                # Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/client_secret*.json        # Google OAuth client secrets
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.txt
run_output.txt
logs/
backups/
downloads/
screenshots/
*.bak
run_jarvis_monitored.py

# ── KruxoAI Commercial Distribution & Privacy ──────────────────────────────────
*.exe
KruxoAI.exe
providers/voices/*.onnx
config/license.json
config/buyers_registry.json
memory/license_requests.json
memory/tamper_alerts.json
config/antigravity_inbox.json
memory/biometric_2fa_audit.json
memory/room_sentry_events.json
memory/voice_emotion_history.json
memory/sleep_tracker_log.json
memory/sleep_report_*.json
memory/voice_biometrics.json
memory/observed_activity.json
memory/notes/
memory/tasks/
reports/
memory/living_journal.jsonl
memory/living_state.json
memory/living_config.json
